    "system": {
        "id": "peaceful-solution",
        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Free Action\" aria-label=\"Free Action\">0</span></p><p><em>The best battle is one you don’t have to fight. If your calm appeals meet willing hearts, you’d rather end the conflict peacefully.</em></p><p>In combat, if all non-minion enemies are currently pacified (such as by @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.ObDHVO8mAqRCbvya]{Calm Appeal}) and all other non-minion characters agree to cease hostilities, you can ease tensions. The combat immediately ends and becomes a conversation.</p><p>At the GM’s discretion, you can use this talent in non-combat scenes.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span style=\"font-family: &#x27;Cosmere Dingbats&#x27;\">0</span></p><p>If all non-minion enemies are pacified, you ease tensions and end combat.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Free Action\" aria-label=\"Free Action\">0</span></p><p>In combat, if all non-minion enemies are currently pacified (such as by Calm Appeal) and all other non-minion characters agree to cease hostilities, you can ease tensions. The combat immediately ends and becomes a conversation.</p><p>At the GM’s discretion, you can use this talent in non-combat scenes.</p>"
        },
